# Observability — Audit, Logs, Metrics, Tracing (Python)

Institutional systems are debuggable by design.
If it’s not observable, it doesn’t exist.

## 1) Event Sourcing Standard
All important actions emit immutable events to an append-only store.

### Required Event Fields
- event_id (uuid)
- ts_wall (UTC ISO)
- ts_mono (monotonic ns)
- correlation_id (per decision/order lifecycle)
- run_id (process start id)
- strategy_id
- venue / market / symbol
- schema_version
- source ("mdp", "strategy", "risk", "oms", "exec", "posttrade")

### Core Event Types
MarketDataEvent
FeatureEvent
SignalEvent
OrderIntentEvent
RiskCheckEvent
OrderCreatedEvent
OrderSubmittedEvent
OrderAckEvent
OrderRejectedEvent
CancelRequestedEvent
OrderCanceledEvent
FillEvent
PositionUpdatedEvent
PnLEvent
ReconcileEvent
CircuitBreakerEvent
KillSwitchEvent
SystemStartedEvent
SystemStoppedEvent

## 2) Correlation IDs (Non-negotiable)
- One correlation_id per "decision → resulting order actions".
- Orders also have:
  - order_id (internal uuid)
  - client_order_id (idempotency key)
  - venue_order_id (when known)

Every log line must include correlation_id when applicable.

## 3) Structured Logging (JSON)
Mandatory fields when relevant:
- correlation_id, order_id, client_order_id, venue_order_id
- strategy_id, run_id
- market, venue
- event_type
- latency_ms
- error_class (retryable/fatal)

Never log secrets.

## 4) Metrics (Minimum Set)
### Market Data
- md_updates_total
- md_staleness_seconds (gauge)
- md_gap_total
- md_reconnect_total
- md_book_mid (gauge)
- md_spread (gauge)

### Strategy
- strategy_eval_total
- strategy_eval_latency_ms (histogram)
- order_intents_total

### Risk
- risk_checks_total{allowed=true/false}
- risk_denials_total{reason=...}
- risk_projected_exposure (gauge)

### OMS/Execution
- orders_submitted_total
- orders_live (gauge)
- cancels_total
- rejects_total
- fills_total
- submit_latency_ms, ack_latency_ms, fill_latency_ms
- adapter_errors_total{class=...}
- queue_depth (gauge)

### Posttrade
- position_net{market=...} (gauge)
- pnl_realized, pnl_unrealized (gauge)
- drawdown (gauge)

### Safety
- execution_enabled (gauge 0/1)
- kill_switch (gauge 0/1)
- circuit_breaker_total{type=...}

## 5) Tracing (OpenTelemetry style)
Span hierarchy suggestion:
- StrategyCycle
  - RiskCheck
  - OMSCreate
  - ExecSubmit
- VenueUserStreamMessage
  - OMSUpdate
  - PosttradeUpdate
- ReconciliationRun

Each span includes correlation_id.

## 6) Replayability Checks
- Every production run writes:
  - ConfigLoaded (hash)
  - SystemStarted/SystemStopped
  - VenueConnected/VenueDisconnected
- On restart, system can:
  - rebuild projections from event store
  - reconcile venue truth
  - continue safely (or disable execution)
